WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:08.950
Here we see a cute young kid who’s drawn
himself a moustache with the help

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.730
of a sketchpen!

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:14.690
But apart from being cute, the image conveys
a lot!

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:15.980
Yes!

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:19.030
And
one such important message which we all relate

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.090
to is the goal of becoming an
adult!

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:27.880
Yes, as kids we all feel like growing up being
like the elders in our family.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.900
However, little do we know what it actually
takes to reach that stage in life!

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.900
Is it difficult?

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.660
In this video and the upcoming ones we will
see what exactly

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.309
makes us grow from a small kid to an adult.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:47.629
Let us get introduced to the
concept of ADOLESCENCE and PUBERTY in this

00:00:47.629 --> 00:00:48.629
video.

00:00:48.629 --> 00:00:52.300
Wait a second…is there a difference between
the two terms?

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.860
Of course yes!

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.690
Let us talk about Adolescence first.

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:01.839
The term Adolescence comes from the
Latin word Adolescere which literally means

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:03.460
to grow up.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.860
So is adolescence the
activity of growing up?

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.530
Or is it the changes that occur in our body
when we

00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:11.100
grow up?

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:14.140
Or is it simply the phase of growing up?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:17.890
Well the term refers to the PHASE OF GROWTH.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:18.890
Yes!

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:23.049
The TIME PERIOD in
which several changes occur in a kid’s body

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:27.840
that turns him or her into an adult,
is called Adolescence.

00:01:27.840 --> 00:01:30.630
This time period is remarkably marked by not
only

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:36.780
physical, but also mental, emotional and psychological
changes in the person.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:41.670
So if this is the meaning of Adolescence,
then what could PUBERTY mean?

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:42.670
Just
take a guess!

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.320
Let me help you with that.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.439
If adolescence is the time period or

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:52.630
stage of development, then shouldn’t puberty
be the ACTUAL CHANGES?

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:53.810
Yes!

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:58.750
Puberty refers to the process of changes…
bodily changes to be precise.

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:02.880
Do we know the age group in which the era
of adolescence shines upon the

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.880
kid?

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.880
Yes!

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.170
Correctly guessed!

00:02:06.170 --> 00:02:08.700
The age which ranges from around THIRTEEN
TO

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.120
NINETEEN YEARS is the time for adolescence.

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.290
And don’t we know a particular
name for this age group?

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.290
Of course!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.610
It is called the TEEN AGE!

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.950
It’s the age
during which there are many transformations

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:22.060
happening in the individual.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:28.090
In simple words can we say that adolescence
is more like a journey?

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.849
And then
what will puberty be?

00:02:30.849 --> 00:02:35.680
Puberty can be thought of as the various junctions
where the train halts!

00:02:35.680 --> 00:02:38.760
Each junction is different from the other
and has specific

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.760
variations.

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.950
Can you tell me where this journey takes us?

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:43.950
Yes!

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:47.390
The final
destination will be ADULTHOOD!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:51.290
And how do we understand that the
destination of adulthood has reached?

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:56.569
The most important characteristic of
adulthood is REPRODUCTIVE MATURITY.

00:02:56.569 --> 00:02:57.760
Yes!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:02.880
The bodies of male as well as
female individuals become capable of reproduction.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.660
However the journey is not extra ordinarily
fascinating as it seems, because

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.850
there are many problems faced on the way.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:17.709
In a nutshell, Adolescence and
puberty change the individual in many ways.

00:03:17.709 --> 00:03:22.280
To understand the changes that occur during
puberty do watch our next video!

